WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Enter opens the video-player dialog.
Keyboard focus should move inside it.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:12.000
Focus stays outside the new dialog.
The checker reports a focus-entry failure.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.570
The checker tries Escape on the active dialog.
The dialog should close.

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:52.000
The same dialog is still visible.
The checker reports an Escape failure.
